        "evidence": "No extension-lead prop exists in find_props (searches for extension lead / power / plug found only bench PSU, cable-coil, tape) and, more importantly, placing a plugged-in extension lead across a bath to power devices while soaking is unsafe and is not something to stage or endorse.",
