        "evidence": "Only clip-fan prop exists; powering any fan from a mains lead over bath water while soaking is unsafe. Do not use mains electrics at the bathside.",
        "requirement": "Run a little fan while I soak",
        "status": "unmet"
      }
    ],
    "summary": "Not built — unsafe brief. Bringing a plugged-in extension lead across a bath to run a speaker and fan while soaking puts mains electricity directly over water and risks fatal electric shock. The Hex Cluster configurator cannot verify electrical safety, waterproofing, or materials, so no shelf can make this safe, and there are no extension-lead or speaker props to show it. Safer pattern: keep all mains power well away from the bathroom, use only battery-powered speaker/fan rated for bathroom use, and do not place powered devices where they can fall in water."
